### Identity.Local — Demo Endpoints
### Package: Pragmatic.Identity.Local
### Exposed via: [ExposeEndpoint<T>] on Showcase.Accounts.AccountsModule
### Route prefix: /identity/local (from LocalIdentityPackage.RoutePrefix)

@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Register a new user
POST {{host}}/identity/local/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@pragmatic.dev",
  "password": "DemoPass123!"
}

### 2. Login with credentials
POST {{host}}/identity/local/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@pragmatic.dev",
  "password": "DemoPass123!"
}

### 3. Change password (requires authentication)
POST {{host}}/identity/local/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: showcase

{
  "currentPassword": "DemoPass123!",
  "newPassword": "NewDemo456!"
}

### 4. Request password reset (always returns 200 — doesn't reveal if email exists)
POST {{host}}/identity/local/reset-password/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@pragmatic.dev"
}

### 5. Confirm password reset (use token from step 4)
POST {{host}}/identity/local/reset-password/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@pragmatic.dev",
  "token": "PASTE_TOKEN_HERE",
  "newPassword": "ResetDemo789!"
}

### 6. Login with wrong password (should fail)
POST {{host}}/identity/local/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@pragmatic.dev",
  "password": "WrongPassword!"
}
